cs. \n- Tons of physics weapons\n- Infinite maps \n- Variety of utility guns that allow you to manipulate the game's objects and environment in new and exciting ways", "short_description": "Newton's Playground is a physics-based VR sandbox, where you can do pretty much anything you would want to. Introducing one of the most advanced and dynamic physics game in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1D6BNfGb6atkqQcC0nfnctZJA78mcOWpeP5nuttz7Wlw/edit", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CXW3P6emNNMZfK3T2PD8m-kpTUXwP29LklLVhr6prX8/edit", "publisher_name": "Sloppy Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.sloppystudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24802835465982620"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 27, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2341671366609658"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1104807735728389"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1007707185196787"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2505816829886222"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "993638363137043"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "4405918759628599"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1917293442992043"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1261219592131953"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4299545590312688"}, {"status": "PUBL